<FluentStack Orientation="Orientation.Vertical" VerticalGap="16px" Class="my-2">
    <FluentText>
        The <a href="/manage/training">Training Dashboard</a>'s By Course and By Person tabs show
        live status for every assignment. The Timing and Analytics tabs turn that into reports.
    </FluentText>

    <FluentText As="TextTag.H5" Size="TextSize.Size400">Timing reports</FluentText>
    <FluentText>
        For a selected course, shows the average time taken to complete it, plus a breakdown of
        average time spent per section, useful for spotting a section that's taking people far
        longer than expected.
    </FluentText>

    <FluentText As="TextTag.H5" Size="TextSize.Size400">Analytics reports</FluentText>
    <FluentText>
        For a selected course, shows top-scoring trainees, fastest and slowest completions, and a
        donut chart of how the assigned group splits across Not Started / In Progress / Completed
        / Overdue.
    </FluentText>

    <FluentMessageBar Intent="MessageBarIntent.Warning">
        There is no automatic email reminder for overdue or newly-assigned training. The only
        training email the system sends is a retake reminder for courses with recurrence enabled,
        when someone's retake window comes up. For everything else, check the dashboard rather
        than waiting for a notification.
    </FluentMessageBar>
</FluentStack>
